&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1wct3r9&quot; data-start=&quot;1580&quot; data-end=&quot;1597&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1599&quot; data-end=&quot;1847&quot;&gt;As a Compliance Associate at Tamara, you will play a key role in ensuring that Tamara’s operations, products, and communications align with applicable regulatory requirements in the United Arab Emirates and Tamara’s internal governance standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1849&quot; data-end=&quot;2126&quot;&gt;You will support compliance activities across frameworks governed by UAE regulators including the &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1947&quot; data-end=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Central Bank of the UAE (CBUAE)&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1984&quot; data-end=&quot;1992&quot;&gt;DFSA&lt;/strong&gt; (where relevant), &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2011&quot; data-end=&quot;2024&quot;&gt;ADGM FSRA&lt;/strong&gt; (where relevant), and other applicable consumer protection, AML, privacy, and payments regulations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2128&quot; data-end=&quot;2266&quot;&gt;You will help maintain a strong compliance framework that promotes accountability, transparency, and readiness for regulatory oversight.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2268&quot; data-end=&quot;2648&quot;&gt;You will support the department in reviewing policies, contracts, products, and advertisements; conducting internal compliance reviews; preparing regulatory submissions; and ensuring all compliance activities are properly documented and traceable. Through your work, you will help safeguard Tamara’s regulatory standing while enabling responsible business growth and innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2650&quot; data-end=&quot;2813&quot;&gt;You are detail-oriented, curious, and collaborative, someone who thrives in a fast-paced, evolving environment where compliance acts as a trusted business partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1115ljy&quot; data-start=&quot;2820&quot; data-end=&quot;2844&quot;&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2846&quot; data-end=&quot;4241&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;kdn7bd&quot; data-start=&quot;2846&quot; data-end=&quot;3010&quot;&gt;Support as a point of contact with UAE regulators by helping the team prepare responses, track requests, and organize regulatory communications and inspections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;c42303&quot; data-start=&quot;3011&quot; data-end=&quot;3164&quot;&gt;Help prepare and submit regulatory reports, both periodic and ad hoc, by coordinating with internal teams to collect and verify required information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1jq02ga&quot; data-start=&quot;3165&quot; data-end=&quot;3318&quot;&gt;Assist in conducting compliance reviews and monitoring activities to ensure internal practices meet UAE regulatory requirements and company policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;i5xu59&quot; data-start=&quot;3319&quot; data-end=&quot;3516&quot;&gt;Review policies, contracts, products, customer journeys, and marketing materials with guidance from senior team members to ensure alignment with regulatory and consumer protection requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;wy4l4y&quot; data-start=&quot;3517&quot; data-end=&quot;3657&quot;&gt;Work closely with business teams to help them understand regulatory expectations and ensure new initiatives are compliant before launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1cqr4ct&quot; data-start=&quot;3658&quot; data-end=&quot;3772&quot;&gt;Help develop and update compliance guides, trackers, and awareness materials to support different departments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1lq6hj2&quot; data-start=&quot;3773&quot; data-end=&quot;3893&quot;&gt;Support in maintaining and updating the Annual Compliance Plan, tracking deadlines, progress, and follow-up actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1723qqo&quot; data-start=&quot;3894&quot; data-end=&quot;4038&quot;&gt;Ensure all compliance activities, reports, and communications with regulators are clearly documented and easy to trace for future reference.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1bwyq5x&quot; data-start=&quot;4039&quot; data-end=&quot;4147&quot;&gt;Track and follow up on open compliance observations to ensure they are resolved within agreed timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;4bfnvw&quot; data-start=&quot;4148&quot; data-end=&quot;4241&quot;&gt;Support AML/CFT, sanctions screening, and customer protection initiatives where required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
