&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;9dphr7&quot; data-start=&quot;5878&quot; data-end=&quot;5985&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Motivated by Tamara’s mission to uphold trust, transparency, and excellence in compliance and governance.&lt;/li&gt;
